  horizontal slide 5 mm inside the trim. No cover name and no final box number is in the code.
- `questArtPosition` (Q1): the first of `50% 50%` and `50% 100%` that keeps every dog-body and
  title-object box inside the trim and every head box inside it or at most 12 mm above the top edge.
  The centred position returns null, so the default render keeps its bytes.
- The painted default group of a part comes from the geometry constants of the render plus the
  measured paint offsets of the role bar, the week pill, and the leaf footer, which the Chrome
